{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-79741" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the differential $\\text{d}f$ for the function $f(x,y)={e}^{xy}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14059898/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d87ed6768b1ac7be0005d61d94f675f7dc8b308097c7536bf478982ab815634"} {"question" "q-79741" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We compute the differential using the formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}f(x,y) & =(\\frac{∂f}{∂x})\\,\\text{d}x+(\\frac{∂f}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =y{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}x+x{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14059898/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d87ed6768b1ac7be0005d61d94f675f7dc8b308097c7536bf478982ab815634"} {"question" "q-79741" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14059898/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "9da65973e7e0817624f392cc1c48c18427d3da80f1ceeeeab25e63d33dcd83f2"} {"question" "q-79741" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14059898/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d87ed6768b1ac7be0005d61d94f675f7dc8b308097c7536bf478982ab815634"} {"question" "q-79741" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "x{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}x+y{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}y"] ["math" "y\\text{d}x+x\\text{d}y"] ["math" "y\\text{d}x+{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}y"] ["math" "y{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}x+x{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}y"] ["math" "{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}x+{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}y"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/h